  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull;<strong> Brand introduction</strong>: <a href=\"https://yongxijewelry.com/\" title=\"Women's Jewelry: Rings, Necklaces, Earrings &amp; More | YongxiJewelry\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">YongxiJewelry.com</a> isn't just another online jewelry store. We're passionate about creating exquisite pieces that empower women to express their unique styles, celebrate special moments, and sparkle without breaking the bank. Unlike traditional luxury brands, we believe affordability doesn't mean compromising on quality or design.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;<br>&bull;<strong> Product description</strong>: We offer a diverse range of women's jewelry, from contemporary trends to timeless classics.<br><em>We Discover:</em><br>1. Dazzling diamonds and shimmering gemstones that capture the light and your heart.<br>2. Elegant pearls and vintage-inspired pieces for a touch of timeless sophistication.<br>3. Modern and playful designs that reflect your individual flair.<br>4. Gift-worthy jewelry for birthdays, anniversaries, or simply to show you care.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;&bull; <strong>USP (Unique Selling Point)</strong>: 1. More Than Just Affordability.<br>2. Exceptional craftsmanship using high-quality materials and meticulous attention to detail.<br>3. Ethical sourcing practices that ensure responsible gemstone mining and fair labor conditions.<br>4. Regular jewelry sales and special offers to make luxury accessible to everyone.<br>5. Primrose Jewelry and other curated collections for unique and personalized treasures.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Payment terms: &nbsp;You will get a 25% commission on total referral sales when a customer finish a purchase through your affiliate link or uses your coupon code via paypal.&n